ny was founded in 1998 and is headquartered in Everett, Washington.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Josh  Simon | CEO & Director | Age 46 | Compensation: $1.1M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 1K people. Revenue per employee of $823K ranks in the top quartile among Consumer Cyclical peers, improving at 7%/yr \u2014 growing workforce leverage. Stock-based compensation of $10K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 1\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (8/10).","financial_summary":["Funko, Inc. is a small-cap consumer cyclical business with a $376M market cap on $908M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at -12% over the past three years, and a shrinking top line is the hardest headwind any business can overcome.","Returns on capital run at -1% against a 11% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The company is burning through $38M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","Accruals are elevated at -9.1% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, debt is heavy at 13.5\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and leverage like that is what turns a bad year into a permanent loss, and thin -2.5\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 2/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (1.3) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Very elevated short interest (17.0% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Revenue growth in the bottom decile of Consumer Cyclical peers \u2014 losing share inside the profit pool","sev":"red","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Operating margins 13% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Trading near 52-week highs \u2014 the market has already recognised the story","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.0928725701943847},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Insiders are overwhelmingly selling (91% sell ratio) \u2014 the people who know the business want less of it","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","ratio":0.091},{"text":"Brand relevance decay \u2014 shifting consumer preferences and social-media-driven trends can strand inventory and invalidate positioning faster than product cycles can adapt.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Valued at a 46% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Consumer Cyclical sector outperforming the broader market over the past quarter"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Funko Inc (FNKO) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/funko-inc-fnko-q3-2026-081439787.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793952879.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Funko Inc (FNKO) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Highlights: Margin Expansion and Deleveraging Offset ...","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/funko-inc-fnko-q3-2026-052655468.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp